        {
          "kind": "text",
          "value": "If $a^x = b^y = c^z$ and $b^2 = ac$, then which of the following relations between $x, y, z$ holds?"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "$y = \\frac{2xz}{x + z}$"
          }
        ],
        [
